[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11522.71, "timestamp": "03:12:02", "text": "是的，尽管大家都说“不，不，不”。上方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11527.19, "timestamp": "03:12:07", "text": "头。头顶上方。头顶上方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11528.87, "timestamp": "03:12:08", "text": "上方还有一条白线"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11531.91, "timestamp": "03:12:11", "text": "头部，对吧？哦。哦，是的。是的。等等，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11533.59, "timestamp": "03:12:13", "text": "没看到。我的天啊。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11535.03, "timestamp": "03:12:15", "text": "是的，我看到了。我懂了。我懂了。你如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11537.269, "timestamp": "03:12:17", "text": "没看到吗？好的。好的。是的。因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11542.63, "timestamp": "03:12:22", "text": "有统计数据。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11560.429, "timestamp": "03:12:40", "text": "等待。压力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11564.309, "timestamp": "03:12:44", "text": "东西。压力。呃，那东西可以呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11567.75, "timestamp": "03:12:47", "text": "我的天啊，我死了。哇。"}]